/.vs

# --- Secrets: never commit real keys / connection strings ---
# Production / environment overrides that hold credentials:
**/appsettings.Production.json
**/appsettings.*.local.json
# Local copies of web.config that hold the real Jwt__Key / connection string on the server.
# The tracked src/NkplmErp.API/web.config keeps only placeholders.
**/web.config.local
**/web.secrets.config
# User-secrets are stored outside the repo by design (no rule needed).

# --- Build artifacts (should never be committed; they also copy secrets) ---
**/bin/
**/obj/
